===Noun===
{{wp}}
{{en-noun}}

# An agent of one [[intelligence]] [[agency]] or group who pretends to be interested in [[defect]]ing or [[turn]]ing to another intelligence agency or group.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2017|author=Nancy Howell Lee; Peter Dale Scott; Bertram Gross|title=Forbidden Bookshelf's Resistance in America Collection
|passage=The example of Oswald will show how the different operations of a '''dangle''' and a barium meal would work more efficiently together.}}
# {{lb|en|slang|ice hockey|lacrosse}} The action of [[dangling]]; a series of complex stick tricks and fakes in order to defeat the defender in style.
#: {{ux|en|That was a sick '''dangle''' for a great goal!}}
# A dangling ornament or decoration.

